---
// Solution.astro
---

<section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50/50 via-white to-slate-50/50 py-24 md:py-32 border-b border-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">

    <!-- Section Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 mb-4 shadow-sm">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 animate-pulse"></span>
      Our Proven Framework
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-tight">
      Our <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600">Conversion-Focused</span> Approach
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal">
      We don’t just design digital brochures — we engineer high-performance web systems built to turn casual visitors into high-value enquiries.
    </p>

    <!-- 3-Step Grid Cards -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-left">

      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="group bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-200 transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 group-hover:bg-blue-50 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">STEP 01</span>
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">01</div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Strategy & Architecture</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
            We analyze your target audience, clarify your unique offer, and map out clear conversion goals before writing a single line of code.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>● Target Auditing</span>
          <span>● Wireframing</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="group bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-200 transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 group-hover:bg-indigo-50 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">STEP 02</span>
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">02</div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">Conversion-Based Design</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
            Clear messaging hierarchies, instant WhatsApp/call CTAs, and mobile-first layouts meticulously engineered to drive immediate user action.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>● UI/UX Design</span>
          <span>● Mobile First</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="group bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:border-emerald-200 transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 group-hover:bg-emerald-50 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">STEP 03</span>
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">03</div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Launch & Scale</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
            Lightning-fast performance via modern tech stacks, SEO-ready code structures, and comprehensive tracking to ensure your business grows.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>● SEO Ready</span>
          <span>● High Speed</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>